+def added_member_parent_paths(template: dict, graph: dict) -> set:
+    """MODIFICATION-20261027-gcfpe-backlog-open-items C-19: the one bounded exception to the rule that no value-table
+    entry targets member_registry. A sole added node the template does not carry has no template-carried staged
+    parent, so a release-values file may set exactly its member_registry staged_parent_id and notion_page_manifest
